<title>CHINA: Korea's Ssangyong in China telecom deal.</title>
<headline>Korea's Ssangyong in China telecom deal.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Ssangyong Corp has reached a preliminary agreement with Beijing Huaxun Group on an investment of up to $200 million in digital telecommunications, Huaxun officials and state media said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The project is still under negotiation,&quot; an official of Huaxun Group told Reuters by telephone.</p>
<p>She gave no further details.</p>
<p>The China News Service quoted an official of Ssangyong Corp as saying the South Korean Corp had a preliminary accord on an investment for a modern telecommunication system.</p>
<p>Huaxun operates paging networks.</p>
</text>
